<title>GREECE: Greek state borrowing schedule for June-Dec 97.</title>
<headline>Greek state borrowing schedule for June-Dec 97.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek deputy Finance Minister Nikos Christodoulakis provided the following information on the state's domestic borrowing schedule for June-December 1997.</p>
<p>The borrowing schedule is indicative, he added.</p>
<p>	    DATE OF ISSUE/TENDER	TYPE OF SECURITIES</p>
<p>		  June 2		    12-month T-bills</p>
<p>    June	June 17 (auction)     reopen bids for 3-,5-,7-yr</p>
<p>						bonds auctioned March 21</p>
<p>		  June 26 (auction)     7-yr FRNs</p>
<p>		  July 1		    12-month T-bills, 2-yr zeros</p>
<p>    July	July 15 (auction)     Fixed coupon bonds</p>
<p>		  July 29 (auction)     FRNs</p>
<p>		  July 30		   12-month T-bills</p>
<p>		  August 11		 CPI-linked bonds</p>
<p>    August    August 20		 12-month T-bills</p>
<p>		  August 21 (auction)   FRNs</p>
<p>		  Sept 2		    2-yr zeros</p>
<p>    September Sept 12		   T-bills</p>
<p>		  Sept 17 (auction)     Fixed coupon bonds</p>
<p>		  Sept 26 (auction)     FRNs</p>
<p>		  Sept 30		   12-month T-bills</p>
<p>		  October 10		2-yr zeros</p>
<p>    October   October 20 (auction)  FRNs</p>
<p>		  October 29 (auction)  FRNs</p>
<p>		  October 31</p>
<p>12-month T-bills</p>
<p>		  November 12	     2-yr zeros</p>
<p>November  November 19 (auction) Fixed coupon bonds</p>
<p>		  November 26 (auction) FRNs</p>
<p>		  December 2		12-month T-bills</p>
<p>    December  December 12	     CPI-linked bonds</p>
<p>		  December 15 (auction) Fixed coupon bonds</p>
<p>		  December 29 (auction) FRNs</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
